","source_cn":"怎么样？找到那个小坏蛋的踪迹了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFDA271FF9BDEFAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1631147001":{"text":"어때? 그 못된 녀석의 흔적은 찾았어?","source_cn":"怎么样？找到那个小坏蛋的踪迹了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFDA271FF9BDEFAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1631147002:0":{"text":"젠장! 도망칠 경로까지 다 계획해 놨다 이거지? 교활한 녀석 같으니!","source_cn":"可恶！这家伙居然连逃跑路线都规划好了！真是个狡猾的惯犯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x950DD5ED00E4DE8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1631147003:0":{"text":"감히 내 구역에서 그렇게 날뛰다니, 절대 그냥 두지 않겠어!","source_cn":"竟敢在我的地盘上这么嚣张！我发誓绝不会放过他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24DFFCAA0CFEEDF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1631147004:0":{"text":"흥... 그래도 고마워. 적어도 바보처럼 이 구멍만 지키고 있을 필요는 없다는 걸 알았으니까.","source_cn":"哼……不过还是谢了。至少现在我知道不用再像个傻瓜一样死...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CC89C63FB13B34E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1631147005:0":{"text":"언젠가 녀석을 잡으면 네가 도와준 걸 잊지 않을게!","source_cn":"如果哪天我逮住了他，这份功劳肯定算你一份！","status":"matched","ha